# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Kept OUT of the Vercel deployment.
#
# The site is one static file (index.html) plus screenshots, so nothing here is
# needed at runtime. src/ and tools/ are deliberately NOT ignored: they are
# committed so anyone can rebuild, and keeping them in the deployment makes the
# deployed copy self-documenting. The whole repo is ~2.5 MB.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

# Local tooling scratch space (headless Chrome profiles live here)
.verify/

# Git internals — Vercel clones the repo and must not receive this
.git/
.gitattributes
.gitignore

# GitHub-only files
.github/
CONTRIBUTING.md
DEPLOY.md

# Local environment and editor noise
.vercel/
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
.vscode/
.idea/
node_modules/

# OS noise
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini
